; Regression: the address of a name two Scaly functions share is refused
; (2026-09-28). An address names ONE function and there are no arguments to
; choose by; the reference silently took the first registered.
; xfail: cannot take the address of twice: 2 functions have this name

function twice(a: int) returns int
    a * 2

function twice(a: int, b: int) returns int
    (a + b) * 2

let f &twice
let r f(3)
print "unreachable `r`"
